**How it works:**

| Concern | How it's met |
|---|---|
| **No extra DML / SOQL** | The class only mutates in-memory field values on the already-loaded `Trigger.new` record. The `before insert` context means those mutations are persisted with the original DML. |
| **Bulk-safe (200 leads)** | TAF instantiates one `TA_Lead_NormalizeContactInfo` per record and calls `execute()` in a loop. Each call is O(1) string work—no governor-limit risk. |
| **Null safety** | `Email` and `Company` are guarded with a `!= null` check before calling `.trim()`, so a null email stays null. `String.isBlank()` returns `true` for both `null` and whitespace-only strings, so `LeadSource` is set to `'Web'` only when there is no meaningful value. |
| **Existing values preserved** | A non-blank `LeadSource` is never overwritten; a non-null `Email`/`Company` keeps its value (just trimmed / lower-cased). |

